REGIONAL REGULATION OF WONOSOBO REGENCY

NUMBER 2 OF 2012

CONCERNING

SOCIAL PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF WONOSOBO,

Considering:

a. that social problems of women and children in Wonosobo Regency continue to increase and become increasingly complex, thus requiring comprehensive, integrated and sustainable prevention efforts organized by the Regional Government, community and business sector;
b. that the implementation of social protection for women and children still has gaps in its handling thus needs to receive priority according to what is needed;
c. that social affairs are mandatory affairs which are the duties and responsibilities of the Regional Government, thus requiring regulation regarding social protection for women and children;
d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation of Wonosobo Regency concerning Social Protection for Women and Children;

